creatures:
- name: Cultist Fanatic
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 13  
      **Hit Points** 44 (rollable(dice=8d8 + 8,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Initiative) (12)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Deception Check), Persuasion rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Persuasion Check), Religion rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Religion Check)  
      **Gear** holy symbol, leather armor  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 12  
      **Languages** Common  
      **Challenge** 2 (450 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Pact Blade.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Pact Blade]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+2,dicelabel=Damage [Pact Blade]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Pact Blade]) Necrotic damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The cultist casts one of the following spells, using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12, rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Spell Attack]) to hit with spell attacks):

      At will: [Light](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618996-light), [Thaumaturgy](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619174-thaumaturgy)  
      2/day: [Command](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618985-command)  
      1/day: [Hold Person](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619153-hold-person)  

      ***Spiritual Weapon (2/Day).*** The cultist casts the [Spiritual Weapon](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619081-spiritual-weapon) spell, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.

      2/day: [Spiritual Weapon](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619081-spiritual-weapon)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Small Medium Humanoid, Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 2
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024cultistfanatic
  status: 1

